    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d432-f1" n="0" type="source" xml:id="d432-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Kennedy Library, President’s Office Files, Countries, Laos Security,
                    9/1/62–12/31/62. Secret. Drafted by Forrestal.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d432-f2" n="1" xml:id="d432-f2-content">
                <p>According to Kennedy’s appointment book,
                    the meeting lasted until 4:30 p.m., and Taylor also attended. (Ibid., President’s Appointment Book)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d432-f3" n="2" xml:id="d432-f3-content">
                <p>For the results of the meeting, see <ref target="#d433">Documents 433</ref> and
                        <ref target="#d434">434</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
